    {"id":"noteIntro","type":"NoteNode","x":-40,"y":-620,"init":{"label":"Bill of materials, nested","body":"Two BOM levels, both built on **Nest Join**: Parts nest under each **Subassembly** (Door Panel, Drawer Slide); those subassemblies — now carrying a rolled-up **Cost** — nest under each **Product**. **Cube Rollup** sums each row's nested `Quantity × UnitCost` back into a flat total. Edit a UnitCost in **Parts** below and hit F9 — watch it ripple through both levels.","color":"violet","width":460,"height":210}},

